VideoStudio native VIDEO overlay compositor extension

Based on androidx.media3:media3-effect:1.11.1, AndroidX Media3.
DefaultVideoCompositor.java: Copyright 2023 The Android Open Source Project.
VideoCompositorFramePolicy.java and maintained modifications:
Copyright 2026 VideoStudio contributors.

Both are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see LICENSE.
The pristine upstream source and the maintained patch are retained beside the
modified source. Original upstream artifact/source identities and the exact
source-compiled replacement inventory are recorded in build-pins.json and the
generated AAR's META-INF/videostudio/Media3-Video-Overlay-Provenance.json.

This extension is opt-in. It preserves the default compositor path and its
primary clock, queue/fence ownership and input-size ordering. It provides no
new character artwork, voice model, hosted AI service or artistic certification.
